                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Help Dr. Elizabeth solve medical cases and figure out what is wrong with her patients.\nYou visit various places, from farms and boating piers to vet clinics, searching for hidden objects and clues that will help you examine the evidence and make the right diagnosis.\n\nBesides the hidden object scenes, there are also some medical mini games, like analysing blood tests, examining X-rays and checking heart rates. Nothing too special, but it's a fun change from the usual hidden object gameplay and keeps things from getting repetitive.\n\nYou can take your time searching for objects and solving the puzzles without having to rush since there are no timers. It made the whole experience very relaxing, which is exactly what I was looking for. \nOverall, a decent and relaxing hidden object game, but with only three patients to treat, I felt it was a bit short. I enjoyed playing it, but I wouldn't recommend buying it at full price.",
